# Normalise text to LF in the repository: evidence reports and other artifacts are generated on
# Windows hosts, where text-mode writes turn every "\n" into "\r\n". A CR at the end of a line is
# trailing whitespace to `git diff --check`, which is what CHC-COMMITS enforces over the whole
# commit range, so an artifact produced on Windows failed the gate after passing every unit test.
* text=auto

# Falsification fixtures are diffs: their context lines legitimately end in whitespace.
ci/fixtures/*.patch -whitespace
